&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Stack Engineer (React + Python + AWS)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience Level&lt;/strong&gt;: &amp;nbsp;4-7 years&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt; : Pune, Bangalore, Hyderabad or Chennai&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and enhance application dashboard features using&amp;nbsp;React&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;TypeScript.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain backend APIs using&amp;nbsp;Python (FastAPI).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate frontend UI with backend services and&amp;nbsp;AWS-based&amp;nbsp;data systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop&amp;nbsp;serverless&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;container-based&amp;nbsp;applications on AWS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize&amp;nbsp;UI&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;API&amp;nbsp;performance for handling large datasets and reporting needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Debug and troubleshoot application issues using&amp;nbsp;CloudWatch logs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams to define requirements and deliver production-quality software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4-7 years&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;React (TypeScript)&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;and modern UI development principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional experience in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Python backend development&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;(FastAPI or similar frameworks).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;AWS application development&lt;/strong&gt;, including:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AWS Lambda&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;API Gateway&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ECS (or container-based deployment)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;S3, EventBridge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CloudWatch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Secrets Manager / Parameter Store&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid knowledge of&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;REST API&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;design and integration best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;PostgreSQL&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;querying and optimization skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with data-heavy applications or&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;analytics dashboards&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Athena&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;data pipeline&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CI/CD experience with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;CodePipeline&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;and/or&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Terraform&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;SCD Type 2&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;or other data lifecycle patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will be considered for employment without regard to caste, colour, creed, religion, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, age, disability, HIV status, or any other status protected by law. Candidates with disabilities who require accommodations during the recruitment process are encouraged to contact our Talent Acquisition team to place a request.&lt;/p&gt;
